# ######## CELL 14 (v3): cross-simulator check in Sandia CrossSim (v3.2.1) ########
# Estimated run time: ~3-4 h on the A100 runtime (12 CPU cores used, GPU not used), ~5 h on an
# 8-core CPU High-RAM runtime. Already finished jobs are skipped (resumable).
# v3 fixes the slowness of v2: every worker process now uses ONE BLAS thread. Before, each of
# the 12 workers started 12 BLAS threads (144 threads on 12 cores), which made every job
# about 5x slower. Also: a small probe job runs first, workers are sized to the RAM, and jobs
# lost to a killed worker are retried. Uses its own code folder (code_crosssim);
# reads results/v2_core.jsonl, writes results/v2_crosssim.jsonl.

